# Cohesion whitelist (docs/patterns/07).
# Deliberately large, single-concern files that are cohesive by design and
# should NEVER count as an error (unlike the .filesize-baseline ratchet, these
# are permanent, not "split me later"). One path per line; # = comment.
#
# Typical entries: a single-file domain model / schema module, a generated
# file, a large static-data table. Start empty; add with a reason.
#
# Example:
# backend/app/models/__init__.py   # single-file domain model (intentional)
